    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106105" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τωθ-άζω</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>V.</u>
			1368
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Theoc.
			16.9
		</span></i>, etc.: fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τωθάσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Hp. Ma.</u>
					290a
				</span></i>
			 (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τωθάσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					1362
				</span></i>
			 is aor.
			subj.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τωθάσουσι</span> as
				fut. is v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.234
			</span></i>): aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐτώθασα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
				</span></i>
			 l. c., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1381a34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
			</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Or.</u>
				5.159a
			</span></i>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				17
			</span></i>: also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θωτάξω</span>
				(q.v.):—<i>mock, jeer at, flout,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.60
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				1362
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
			</span></i> l. c., <i><span class="en">
				Herod.
				7.103
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλὰ τ. τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
				</span></i>
			 l.c.:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be mocked,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				474a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Decl.</u>
				19.33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs.,
				<i>jeer,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				1368
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
			</span></i> l.c.</div>
